---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Simulations | Your Name">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Simulations</p>
    <h1>Interactive computational experiments</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      The browser-based lab collection includes stochastic processes, statistical mechanics, and numerical experiments.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="grid">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Brownian motion</h2>
      <p>Diffusion and random trajectories in the browser.</p>
      <a href="/labs/brownian/">Open lab →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Markov chains</h2>
      <p>Transition matrices, stationary distributions, and mixing examples.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Monte Carlo</h2>
      <p>Metropolis sampling, acceptance rates, and observable tracking.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Molecular dynamics</h2>
      <p>Particle motion, force-field models, and time integration experiments.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
